<title>HONG KONG: SGA sets warrants on HSBC Holdings Plc.</title>
<headline>SGA sets warrants on HSBC Holdings Plc.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Acceptance NV, SGA, said on Tuesday it has launched 25 million American-style put warrants on shares of HSBC Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$215.65    PREMIUM	 14.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$2.156     GEARING	 10.52x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	 03.JUN.97    SETTLEMENT    CASH</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  03.APR.98</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> NOTE		  PAYMENT DATE THREE WEEKS AFTER ISSUE DATE.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
